.TH PHANTOMGATE 1 "August 2026" "1.1.0" "PhantomGate Manual"
.SH NAME
phantomgate \- Adversary-in-the-Middle reverse proxy framework for red teams
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B phantomgate
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B PhantomGate
is an AiTM reverse proxy that transparently sits between a victim and a real
authentication portal. It captures credentials, intercepts MFA tokens, and
steals authenticated session cookies in real-time.
.PP
Features include YAML-based phishlet system, real-time operator dashboard,
ARP+DNS poisoning for LAN interception, rogue AP creation, dynamic CA
certificate generation, and captive portal for CA distribution.
.PP
\fBWARNING:\fR This tool is designed \fBexclusively\fR for authorized
penetration testing and Red Team engagements. Unauthorized use is illegal.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Core Options
.TP
.BI \-\-domain " DOMAIN"
Phishing domain name (required). Example: login-secure.com
.TP
.BI \-\-phishlet " NAME"
Phishlet to activate (required). Use \-\-list to see available phishlets.
.TP
.BI \-\-phishlet\-dir " DIR"
Directory containing phishlet YAML files. Default: /usr/share/phantomgate/phishlets
.TP
.BI \-\-config " FILE"
Path to config file. Default: /etc/phantomgate/config.yml
.TP
.BI \-\-listen " IP"
IP to bind listeners on. Default: 0.0.0.0
.TP
.BI \-\-https\-port " PORT"
HTTPS proxy listener port. Default: 443
.TP
.BI \-\-http\-port " PORT"
HTTP redirect listener port. Default: 80
.TP
.BI \-\-admin\-port " PORT"
Operator dashboard port. Default: 8443
.TP
.BI \-\-admin\-pass " PASSWORD"
Dashboard authentication password (required). Minimum 8 characters recommended.
.TP
.BI \-\-store " FILE"
Path for persistent data storage. Default: phantomgate_data.json
.TP
.BI \-\-cert " FILE"
TLS certificate file (PEM) for manual TLS mode.
.TP
.BI \-\-key " FILE"
TLS private key file (PEM) for manual TLS mode.
.SS Phishlet Management
.TP
.B \-\-list
List available phishlets and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-lure " INFO"
Create a lure URL for the specified victim info and print it.
.SS Network Interception
.TP
.B \-\-intercept
Enable DNS interception mode (ARP + DNS poisoning on LAN).
.TP
.B \-\-wizard
Launch interactive wizard for LAN interception setup.
.TP
.BI \-\-iface " NAME"
Network interface for interception. Default: eth0
.TP
.BI \-\-gateway " IP"
Gateway IP for ARP poisoning.
.TP
.BI \-\-victim\-ip " IPS"
Comma-separated victim IPs (empty = entire subnet).
.TP
.BI \-\-poison\-domain " DOMAINS"
Comma-separated domains to poison (e.g., instagram.com,facebook.com).
.SS Rogue Access Point
.TP
.B \-\-rogue\-ap
Create a rogue WiFi access point (bypasses AP isolation).
.TP
.BI \-\-ap\-ssid " SSID"
SSID for the rogue AP. Default: Free_WiFi
.TP
.BI \-\-ap\-pass " PASSWORD"
WPA2 password for rogue AP (empty = open network).
.TP
.BI \-\-ap\-channel " CHANNEL"
WiFi channel for rogue AP. Default: 6
.TP
.BI \-\-ap\-iface " NAME"
WiFi interface for AP (auto-detected if empty).
.SS Dynamic CA & TLS
.TP
.B \-\-use\-ca
Generate dynamic TLS certificates signed by a local CA.
.TP
.B \-\-captive\-portal
Enable captive portal for CA cert distribution.
.SS Operational
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Test configuration without binding ports. Validates settings and exits.
.TP
.B \-\-json\-log
Enable JSON structured logging (for SIEM integration).
.TP
.BI \-\-generate\-completions " SHELL"
Generate shell completion script. Supported: bash, zsh, fish.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Dump live statistics (victim count, credentials, sessions) to stdout.
.TP
.B SIGUSR2
Rotate data store: backup current data, reset to fresh capture.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Standard deployment:
.B sudo phantomgate \-\-domain login-secure.com \-\-phishlet microsoft365 \-\-admin-pass SecureP@ss
.TP
With dynamic CA (no cert warnings):
.B sudo phantomgate \-\-domain login-secure.com \-\-phishlet microsoft365 \-\-admin-pass SecureP@ss \-\-use\-ca
.TP
LAN interception with wizard:
.B sudo phantomgate \-\-domain test.local \-\-phishlet microsoft365 \-\-admin-pass SecureP@ss \-\-wizard
.TP
Rogue AP with captive portal:
.B sudo phantomgate \-\-domain test.local \-\-phishlet microsoft365 \-\-admin-pass SecureP@ss \-\-rogue\-ap
.TP
Validate configuration:
.B phantomgate \-\-domain login-secure.com \-\-phishlet microsoft365 \-\-admin-pass SecureP@ss \-\-dry\-run
.TP
Generate bash completions:
.B phantomgate \-\-generate\-completions bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/phantomgate
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/phantomgate/config.yml
Default configuration file.
.TP
.I /usr/share/phantomgate/phishlets/
Default phishlet directory.
.TP
.I /usr/share/bash\-completion/completions/phantomgate
Bash completion script.
.TP
.I /usr/share/zsh/vendor\-completions/_phantomgate
Zsh completion script.
.TP
.I /usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/phantomgate.fish
Fish completion script.
.TP
.I /lib/systemd/system/phantomgate.service
Systemd service unit file.
.SH HEALTH CHECK
The operator dashboard exposes a health endpoint at /health (no auth required):
.PP
.B curl http://localhost:8443/health
